; Delta-glider: its own keys in the key sheet (alt+F1) - label | keys
Landing gear up/down | G
Nose cone (docking port) | K
Outer airlock | O
Inner airlock | Ctrl+O
Top hatch | U
Radiator | D
Airbrake out / in | B  Ctrl+B
HUD mode (on the panel) | H
Hover thrust up / down | Num 0  Num .
Hover attitude control (Auto) | panel: HOVER ATT CTRL
Control dialog | Ctrl+Space
